    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      187.05,
      203.33,
      376.65,
      214.67
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE UNITED MUSLIM UMMAH",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      228.53,
      401.89,
      290.27
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS an Organization called and known as the \u201cUnitedMuslim Ummah\u201d, has heretofore been formed in Sri Lankafor the purpose of effectually carrying out its objects andtransacting all matters connected with the said institutionaccording to the rules agreed to by its members :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.13,
      401.9,
      365.87
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Organization has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      379.73,
      401.89,
      403.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      417.53,
      401.88,
      441.47
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the United Muslim Ummah(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      455.33,
      401.9,
      580.07
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many person as now are members of the \u201cUnitedMuslim Ummah\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201corganization\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as members ofthe Corporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporatewith perpetual succession, under the name and style of the\u201cUnited Muslim Ummah\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\"Corpotration\") and by that name may sue and be sued, withfull power and authority to have and use a common seal andto alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      589.73,
      401.87,
      613.67
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      624.53,
      382.79,
      635.87
    ],
    "text": "(a) to strive towards building national integration;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      174.09,
      649.01,
      401.88,
      672.35
    ],
    "text": "(b) to strive to establish a true pluralistic society in SriLanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      162.81,
      677.27,
      270.09,
      686.13
    ],
    "text": "2\u2014PL 006797\u201475 (11/2012)",
