  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.39,
      250.97,
      397.19,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "(d) to resolve disputes among the Muslims at regionallevel;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      170.11,
      286.97,
      397.2,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "(e) to contribute to the social and economic uplift of thecountry;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.67,
      322.97,
      397.19,
      358.31
    ],
    "text": "(f) to assist in scholarship, cash or kind for the voluntaryemployees and other employees who are engaged inthe attainment of the objectives of the Corporation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.39,
      370.97,
      397.19,
      394.31
    ],
    "text": "(g) to plan and implement community welfare, eucationaland social development projects in Sri Lanka ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      169.39,
      406.97,
      397.19,
      466.31
    ],
    "text": "(h) to promote education, health, recreation, culture andagriculture, to provide grants, scholarships, gifts,donations and financial assistance for theimprovement, extension and publicize knowledgeand to establish institutions for this purpose; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.67,
      478.97,
      397.18,
      514.31
    ],
    "text": "(i) to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor and incidental or conducive to the attainment ofthe above objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      527.09,
      397.19,
      612.71
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The management, control and administration ofthe Corporation shall, subject to the provision of this Actand the rules in force for the time being of the Corporation,vested in a Board of Management (hereinafter referre to asthe \"Board\") consisting of the office bearers and such otherpersons as may be provided for in such rules and elected inaccordance therewith.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      624.05,
      397.19,
      673.67
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of Management of the Corporationshall consist of the members of the Board of the Institutionholding office on the day preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
