      235.29,
      167.17,
      402.89,
      190.24
    ],
    "text": "3United Muslim Ummah(Incorporation)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.57,
      401.89,
      266.99
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provision of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute, all such acts and matters as necessary ordesirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation or any one of them, including the powers:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.65,
      279.89,
      401.85,
      303.23
    ],
    "text": "(a)to raise funds and receive grants, gifts or donationsin cash or kind whether from local or foreign sources ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.65,
      315.89,
      401.89,
      375.23
    ],
    "text": "(b)to acquire, in any manner whatsoever and hold, takeor give on lease or hire, rent, sell or otherwise disposeof any movable or immovale property and construct,maintain and alter any buildings or works necessaryor convenient for the business of the Corporation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.37,
      387.89,
      401.88,
      447.23
    ],
    "text": "(c)to make, draw, accept, discount, endorse, negotiate,buy, sell and issue bills of exchange, cheques,promissory notes and other negotiable instrumentsand to open, operate and close bank accounts andborrow or raise money with or without security ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.65,
      459.89,
      401.88,
      495.23
    ],
    "text": "(d)to invest any funds not immediately required forthe purposes of the Corporation in such manner asthe Board of Management may determine;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.37,
      507.89,
      401.89,
      543.23
    ],
    "text": "(e)to enter into agreements or contracts with any personor body of persons for the implementation of theseobjects; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      180.81,
      555.89,
      401.89,
      603.23
    ],
    "text": "(f)appoint employ, dismiss or terminate the servicesof officers and servants of the Corporation and topay them such salaries, allowances and gratuities asmay be determined by the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      615.89,
      401.89,
      675.23
    ],
